      "goFurther": "🛠️ Run analyze_competitor() for two different competitors with genuinely different data. Compare the SIGNALS sections - does the AI actually differentiate them, or produce similar boilerplate for both? If similar, feed it more specific data (more job titles, more news items) to sharpen the contrast."
