    "fix": "scrape.py already sends a realistic User-Agent header, but some sites still block automated requests entirely. Add a short delay between requests to different competitors, and don't re-scrape the same page more than once a week - a weekly job hitting a site once is far less likely to trigger blocking than repeated testing runs in a short window."
