  },
  {
    "issue": "Threat-level rankings feel inconsistent between competitors",
    "fix": "Check the REASONING section for each one - THREAT_RUBRIC gives the AI explicit criteria, but if two similar competitors got different rankings, compare their REASONING text to see whether the underlying facts actually differ, or the AI weighed the same facts differently. If the answer wasn't cleanly LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH at all, validate_threat_level() already normalizes it to UNCLEAR rather than guessing - that's a visible flag, not a bug."
  },
