    "issue": "SMTP authentication errors when sending the briefing",
    "fix": "If sending from Gmail, SMTP_PASS needs to be an App Password (myaccount.google.com/apppasswords), not your normal account password - Gmail rejects regular passwords for SMTP entirely."
